hemy/sqlalchemy/issues/3907#issuecomment-441936159","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/3907","id":441936159,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ0MTkzNjE1OQ==","user":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-02-08T22:37:52Z","updated_at":"2018-11-27T06:05:53Z","body":"**Michael Bayer ([@zzzeek](https://github.com/zzzeek)) wrote:**\n\nsurprise, Mariadb thinks the answer is NULL:\n\n\n```\nMariaDB [(none)]> select null not in (select 1 where 1=0);\n+----------------------------------+\n| null not in (select 1 where 1=0) |\n+----------------------------------+\n|                             NULL |\n+----------------------------------+\n1 row in set (0.00 sec)\n\nMariaDB [(none)]> select null in (select 1 where 1=0);\n+------------------------------+\n| null in (select 1 where 1=0) |\n+------------------------------+\n|                         NULL |\n+------------------------------+\n1 row in set (0.00 sec)\n\nMariaDB [(none)]> select 5 not in (select 1 where 1=0);\n+-------------------------------+\n| 5 not in (select 1 where 1=0) |\n+-------------------------------+\n|                             1 |\n+-------------------------------+\n1 row in set (0.00 sec)\n\nMariaDB [(none)]> select 5 in (select 1 where 1=0);\n+---------------------------+\n| 5 in (select 1 where 1=0) |\n+---------------------------+\n|                         0 |\n+---------------------------+\n1 row in set (0.00 sec)\n\n```\n\n\nI was considering maybe we could even let the DB make the decision here by having \"empty set\" just render as \"select 1 where 1=0\", but...this changes that :).    FAQ will have to be revised a lot to point out we're still just guessing here.\n","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/441936159/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url